@startuml

title UC4 - Requisitar Livros

actor User
participant ":System" as System

User -> System: solicitarRequisicao()
activate System

    System --> User: mostrarConfirmacao(detalhesDoEmprestimo)
deactivate System

User -> System: confirmarRequisicao()
activate System

    System -> System: processarRequisicao()

    System --> User: mostrarSucessoRequisicao()
deactivate System

@enduml